      "text": "`ARG` is the wrong way to get a token into a docker build.\n\nbuild args show up in `docker history` for anyone who pulls the image.\n\nuse `RUN --mount=type=secret,id=npm_token` instead. the secret exists for that one step and never lands in a layer.",
